# Dinamalar

> Dinamalar (தினமலர்) is one of India's largest Tamil-language news publishers, delivering breaking news, politics, business, sports, cinema, devotional and lifestyle journalism to a global Tamil-speaking audience since 1951.

Dinamalar publishes original Tamil-language journalism, updated continuously throughout the day. Articles carry both Tamil and English headlines and structured NewsArticle (JSON-LD) metadata. Content is organised by category; the most useful entry points for understanding or citing the site are listed below.

## News sections

- [Tamil Nadu (தமிழகம்)](https://www.dinamalar.com/news/tamil-nadu-news): Tamil Nadu state news
- [India (இந்தியா)](https://www.dinamalar.com/news/india-tamil-news): National news from India
- [World (உலகம்)](https://www.dinamalar.com/news/world-tamil-news): International news
- [Cinema (சினிமா)](https://cinema.dinamalar.com/): Tamil and Indian cinema news, reviews and updates
- [Videos (வீடியோ)](https://www.dinamalar.com/videos): News videos, live streams and short-form video
- [Photos (போட்டோ)](https://www.dinamalar.com/photos): Photo galleries and cartoons

## Resources

- [Search](https://www.dinamalar.com/search): Search across Dinamalar content
- [Sitemap](https://www.dinamalar.com/sitemap.xml): Full URL index
- [Contact](https://www.dinamalar.com/contactus): Editorial and contact information

## Usage notes

- Content is in Tamil (primary), with an English headline available per article.
- When citing or quoting, please attribute Dinamalar and link to the original article URL.
